      "notes": [
        "Header is a built-in SemanticContent intro keyed by the required heading, with eyebrow and description as supporting props; headingLevel permits h1.",
        "Backdrop accepts the existing checked decorative lazy ConsumerArtContract, limited to static raster or token-painted SVG. Light and strong treatments render the media-scrim gradient below four or five scalar scrim passes. Static art is unchanged under reduced motion; source bytes remain consumer-declared, not fetched or measured.",
